   "a": "A",
   "s": "<div class=\"sv\"><div class=\"sv-g\"><b>Verilen</b> <ul><li>Kare mukavva 72 cm², 9 eş kareye ayrılmış; ortadaki kare çıkarılmış.</li> <li>Dış ve iç kenarların tamamına şerit.</li></ul><b>İstenen</b><p>Şeridin uzunluğu.</p></div><ol class=\"sv-s\"><li><b>Kenarlar</b> <span class=\"sv-m\">büyük kare: √72 = 6√2 · küçük kare: 72 ÷ 9 = 8 → √8 = 2√2</span></li> <li><b>Dış kenarlar</b> <span class=\"sv-m\">4 · 6√2 = 24√2</span></li> <li><b>İç kenarlar</b> Çıkarılan karenin dört kenarı: <span class=\"sv-m\">4 · 2√2 = 8√2</span></li> <li><b>Topla</b> <span class=\"sv-m\">24√2 + 8√2 = 32√2 cm</span></li></ol><figure class=\"sv-f\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 225\" width=\"400\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"225\" fill=\"#ffffff\"/><rect x=\"40\" y=\"30\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" fill=\"#fde68a\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><rect x=\"90\" y=\"80\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><line x1=\"90\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"90\" y2=\"180\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/><line x1=\"140\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"140\" y2=\"180\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"130\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"130\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/><rect x=\"40\" y=\"30\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7c3aed\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><rect x=\"90\" y=\"80\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"194\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"194\" stroke=\"#7c3aed\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"189\" x2=\"40\" y2=\"199\" stroke=\"#7c3aed\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><line x1=\"190\" y1=\"189\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"199\" stroke=\"#7c3aed\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"115\" y=\"210\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#7c3aed\" text-anchor=\"middle\">6√2</text><text x=\"115\" y=\"110\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#dc2626\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">2√2</text><text x=\"206\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#7c3aed\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">dış: 4 · 6√2 = 24√2</text><text x=\"206\" y=\"100\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#dc2626\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">iç: 4 · 2√2 = 8√2</text><text x=\"206\" y=\"130\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">toplam: 32√2</text></svg><figcaption>Mor dış kenar 24√2, kırmızı iç kenar 8√2 cm.</figcaption></figure><div class=\"sv-t\"><b>Püf nokta:</b> Delikli şekillerde çevre = dış sınır + iç sınır.</div><div class=\"sv-w\"><b>Tuzak:</b> Yalnızca dış kenarı sayan 24√2; iç kenarı iki kez sayan 40√2 bulur.</div><div class=\"sv-a\">Cevap <b>A</b></div></div>"
