   "a": "C",
   "s": "<div class=\"sv\"><div class=\"sv-g\"><b>Verilen</b> <ul><li>Kareli zeminde turuncu şekil; kenarlar kare çizgileri üzerinde.</li> <li>Şeklin alanı 252 cm².</li></ul><b>İstenen</b><p>Turuncu şeklin çevresi.</p></div><ol class=\"sv-s\"><li><b>Birimkareleri say</b> Şekli dikdörtgenlere bölerek sayarız. <span class=\"sv-m\">sol 2 × 5 = 10 · orta 2 × 2 = 4 · sağ 2 × 3 = 6 · sağ alt 1 → 21</span></li> <li><b>Birimkarenin kenarı</b> <span class=\"sv-m\">252 ÷ 21 = 12 cm² → √12 = 2√3 cm</span></li> <li><b>Çevreyi birim birim say</b> Girintinin iki yanı ve tabanı da çevreye dahildir. <span class=\"sv-m\">5 + 1 + 1 + 3 + 2 + 2 + 2 + 3 + 2 + 5 = 26 birim</span></li> <li><b>Çevre</b> <span class=\"sv-m\">26 · 2√3 = 52√3 cm</span></li></ol><figure class=\"sv-f\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 330 275\" width=\"330\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"330\" height=\"275\" fill=\"#ffffff\"/><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"30\" y2=\"258\" stroke=\"#93c5fd\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"64\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"64\" y2=\"258\" stroke=\"#93c5fd\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"98\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"98\" y2=\"258\" stroke=\"#93c5fd\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"132\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"132\" y2=\"258\" stroke=\"#93c5fd\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"166\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"166\" y2=\"258\" stroke=\"#93c5fd\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"200\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"258\" stroke=\"#93c5fd\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"234\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"234\" y2=\"258\" stroke=\"#93c5fd\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"268\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"268\" y2=\"258\" stroke=\"#93c5fd\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"302\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"302\" y2=\"258\" stroke=\"#93c5fd\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"302\" y2=\"20\" stroke=\"#93c5fd\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"54\" x2=\"302\" y2=\"54\" stroke=\"#93c5fd\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"88\" x2=\"302\" y2=\"88\" stroke=\"#93c5fd\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"122\" x2=\"302\" y2=\"122\" stroke=\"#93c5fd\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"156\" x2=\"302\" y2=\"156\" stroke=\"#93c5fd\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"190\" x2=\"302\" y2=\"190\" stroke=\"#93c5fd\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"224\" x2=\"302\" y2=\"224\" stroke=\"#93c5fd\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"258\" x2=\"302\" y2=\"258\" stroke=\"#93c5fd\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><polygon points=\"64,224 234,224 234,190 268,190 268,88 200,88 200,156 132,156 132,54 64,54\" fill=\"#fdba74\" fill-opacity=\"0.7\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"149\" y=\"244.3\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#dc2626\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">5</text><text x=\"244.2\" y=\"215.4\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#dc2626\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">1</text><text x=\"251\" y=\"184.8\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#dc2626\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">1</text><text x=\"278.2\" y=\"147.4\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#dc2626\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">3</text><text x=\"234\" y=\"82.8\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#dc2626\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">2</text><text x=\"189.8\" y=\"130.4\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#dc2626\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">2</text><text x=\"166\" y=\"150.8\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#dc2626\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">2</text><text x=\"121.8\" y=\"113.4\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#dc2626\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">3</text><text x=\"98\" y=\"48.8\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#dc2626\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">2</text><text x=\"53.8\" y=\"147.4\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#dc2626\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">5</text></svg><figcaption>Kırmızı sayılar her kenarın birim uzunluğu; toplam 26 birim.</figcaption></figure><div class=\"sv-t\"><b>Püf nokta:</b> Girintili şekillerde çevreyi bir köşeden başlayıp dolaşarak say; hiçbir kenarı atlama.</div><div class=\"sv-w\"><b>Tuzak:</b> Şekli 6 × 5 dikdörtgen gibi düşünen 22 birim sayar (44√3); kare sayısını çevre sanan 42√3 bulur.</div><div class=\"sv-a\">Cevap <b>C</b></div></div>"
