   "a": "C",
   "s": "<div class=\"sv\"><div class=\"sv-g\"><b>Verilen</b> <ul><li>Üç eş dikdörtgen uzun kenarlarıyla yan yana → Şekil I (kare, 108 cm²).</li> <li>Aynı dikdörtgenler kısa kenarlarıyla uç uca → Şekil II.</li></ul><b>İstenen</b><p>Şekil II’deki dikdörtgenin çevresi.</p></div><ol class=\"sv-s\"><li><b>Karenin kenarı</b> Bu, dikdörtgenlerin uzun kenarıdır. <span class=\"sv-m\">√108 = 6√3 cm</span></li> <li><b>Kısa kenar</b> Üç kısa kenar karenin kenarını oluşturur. <span class=\"sv-m\">6√3 ÷ 3 = 2√3 cm</span></li> <li><b>Şekil II’nin boyutları</b> <span class=\"sv-m\">uzunluk 3 · 6√3 = 18√3 · genişlik 2√3</span></li> <li><b>Çevre</b> <span class=\"sv-m\">2 · (18√3 + 2√3) = 40√3 cm</span></li></ol><figure class=\"sv-f\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 545 225\" width=\"520\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"545\" height=\"225\" fill=\"#ffffff\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"20\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">Şekil I</text><rect x=\"60\" y=\"30\" width=\"52\" height=\"156\" fill=\"#bfdbfe\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"112\" y=\"30\" width=\"52\" height=\"156\" fill=\"#fde68a\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"164\" y=\"30\" width=\"52\" height=\"156\" fill=\"#bbf7d0\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"112\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"195\" x2=\"60\" y2=\"205\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><line x1=\"112\" y1=\"195\" x2=\"112\" y2=\"205\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"86\" y=\"216\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#dc2626\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2√3</text><line x1=\"52\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"52\" y2=\"186\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><line x1=\"47\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"57\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><line x1=\"47\" y1=\"186\" x2=\"57\" y2=\"186\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"45\" y=\"113\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"end\">6√3</text><text x=\"242\" y=\"20\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">Şekil II</text><rect x=\"242\" y=\"82\" width=\"78\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#bfdbfe\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"320\" y=\"82\" width=\"78\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#fde68a\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"398\" y=\"82\" width=\"78\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#bbf7d0\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"242\" y1=\"122\" x2=\"476\" y2=\"122\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><line x1=\"242\" y1=\"117\" x2=\"242\" y2=\"127\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><line x1=\"476\" y1=\"117\" x2=\"476\" y2=\"127\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"359\" y=\"138\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">18√3</text><line x1=\"488\" y1=\"82\" x2=\"488\" y2=\"108\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><line x1=\"483\" y1=\"82\" x2=\"493\" y2=\"82\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><line x1=\"483\" y1=\"108\" x2=\"493\" y2=\"108\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"495\" y=\"100\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"start\">2√3</text><text x=\"359\" y=\"170\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#7c3aed\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">çevre: 2 · (18√3 + 2√3) = 40√3</text></svg><figcaption>Aynı üç dikdörtgen: Şekil I’de 6√3 × 6√3 kare, Şekil II’de 18√3 × 2√3 şerit.</figcaption></figure><div class=\"sv-t\"><b>Püf nokta:</b> Şekil değişse de parçalar aynıdır; önce tek parçanın kenarlarını bul.</div><div class=\"sv-w\"><b>Tuzak:</b> 24√3 karenin çevresidir; 2 ile çarpmayı unutan 20√3 bulur.</div><div class=\"sv-a\">Cevap <b>C</b></div></div>"
